  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Wrought for the Fist of Sauron, this iron mesh offers a grim defense against the bite of steel and the crushing blow. It molds to the body with a stifling, icy embrace, granting a formidable resilience to those who stand within its shadow."
